(6836928, 1027395, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful viewpoint! How you got that I will never know... I think the multitude of fish and the ripples in the water really help the bird to blend in to it''s background. One thing that could be done in post would be to make the bird a bit brighter, put the spotlight on it. Perhaps it would stand out a little better. Otherwise, a great and probably rare shot!</td>', 'Wonderful viewpoint! How you got that I will never know... I think the multitude of fish and the ripples in the water really help the bird to blend in to it''s background. One thing that could be done in post would be to make the bird a bit brighter, put the spotlight on it. Perhaps it would stand out a little better. Otherwise, a great and probably rare shot!', '2012-08-07 14:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6836931, 1028198, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful thatch roof! A really neat site and this shot shows off it''s fairy tale potential. You really framed this difficult composition well. If it were allowed, cloning out the power pole and lines would help tremendously. I also think the sky being so bright draws my eye up there more than to the subject.</td>', 'Wonderful thatch roof! A really neat site and this shot shows off it''s fairy tale potential. You really framed this difficult composition well. If it were allowed, cloning out the power pole and lines would help tremendously. I also think the sky being so bright draws my eye up there more than to the subject.', '2012-08-07 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
