(6839612, 1027978, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Awesome, Brad; back in the parade! What were you doing in Abilene? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Robt! How ya be? I was in Abilene to be there for my daughter, as she was having her first child, and needed some support &amp; help. Got to do her <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=19708&amp;collection_id=40332" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">maternity pics</a> before hand too.<br/>Sadly, two weeks after my Granddaughter was born, I had to make a mad dash to AZ to be with my Mom, as she went into Hospice (Cancer) and lost her battle about 5 days after getting there.<br/>Been quite the roller coaster ride the last month.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-08-10 22:00:15.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Awesome, Brad; back in the parade! What were you doing in Abilene?  Robt! How ya be? I was in Abilene to be there for my daughter, as she was having her first child, and needed some support & help. Got to do her maternity pics before hand too.Sadly, two weeks after my Granddaughter was born, I had to make a mad dash to AZ to be with my Mom, as she went into Hospice (Cancer) and lost her battle about 5 days after getting there.Been quite the roller coaster ride the last month.', '2012-08-10 22:59:18.000000', '2012-08-10 23:00:15.000000', 0),
