(6839804, 1028264, 112539, '<td valign="top">I loved this! Love the softness of it. Makes it feel like she is enjoying her task. Her expression is perfect as she looks like she is concentrating but still relaxed. Am glad you entered this in the proverb rather than the vintage. I agree that it was just right for the challenge. Congrats on top ten but I wish it had scored higher. I think it should have!</td>', 'I loved this! Love the softness of it. Makes it feel like she is enjoying her task. Her expression is perfect as she looks like she is concentrating but still relaxed. Am glad you entered this in the proverb rather than the vintage. I agree that it was just right for the challenge. Congrats on top ten but I wish it had scored higher. I think it should have!', '2012-08-11 11:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
